{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"big\": \"Y\",\n    \"small\": \"Y\",\n    \"core\": \"平\",\n    \"concise\": \"X\",\n    \"human\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\",\n    \"load\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"big：Y 的大块直接交代人物此刻的状态、原因和变化，单看也能串起全曲；X 只看加亮词容易丢失句间关系。small：Y 的感受和旁注能作为可选补充，大块本身已能独立理解；X 的未加亮文字仍承担较多必要的句法连接。core：两版都持续呈现亲密幸福与留不住它的痛楚，核心没有明显偏移；concise：X 的重复回说相对少，Y 在 S04、S13 等处多次复述已经交代过的担忧。human：X 更符合日常表达，Y 的“那是真的吗该怎么办”“痛痛快快喜欢对方”“幸福并不假只是信过才这么疼”等具体搭配或衔接略显生硬。fine：Y 的感受更常落在肩挨肩、独处泛酸、喉咙发紧等具体体验上，X 有更多篇幅用于描述歌声和声部本身。load：Y 的大块数量总体较少，切分多落在自然意群边界，结合各屏停留时间基本扫得过来；X 虽然每块短，但需要连续捕捉更多加亮片段。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "58f06693-da83-46cd-bfad-740592a070cb", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261110T220730170473Z", "elapsed_seconds": 275.484, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T22:12:05.658833+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "12355e727c62a76bb84173215d51e5090cbdec20364b2292919fbbf6ab1bf744", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf2